<title>PHILIPPINES: MPC unit H1 net 1.05 billion pesos.</title>
<headline>MPC unit H1 net 1.05 billion pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonifacio Land Corp said on Thursday it made a net income of 1.05 billion pesos in the first half of the year from revenues of 1.08 billion.</p>
<p>The firm, which is 56 percent owned by Metro Pacific Corp, did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>Bonifacio Land holds 55 percent of Fort Bonifacio Development Corp, the developer of a 214-hectare property at the edge of Manila's Makati financial district.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
